<title>USA: Illinois direct hogs off $1.00 - USDA.</title>
<headline>Illinois direct hogs off $1.00 - USDA.</headline>
<dateline>SPRINGFIELD 1997-02-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>USDA said barrows and gilts were $1.00 lower. Demand was light. Top $53.50 per cwt.</p>
<p>US 1-2 230-260 lbs. 52.00-53.00, few 53.50</p>
<p>Sows - unevenly steady. Top $54.00.</p>
<p>US 1-3 Under 450 lbs.  41.00-46.00</p>
<p>	     450-500 lbs.  44.00-48.50</p>
<p>	     500-600 lbs.  47.50-52.00</p>
<p>	     over 600 lbs. 48.50-54.00, mostly 52.00-53.00</p>
</text>
